    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid black; color:white; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#db6900;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been found to be <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Unsuitable\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Unsuitable\">Unsuitable</a> for use in play. Gamemasters are advised to be especially cautious if considering the use of its contents.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew&nbsp;Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/New_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"New Republic Campaign Guide\">New Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are in tune with your negotiating abilities.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to adjust the result of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check, you roll d8s instead of d6s. This does not stack with other abilities that modify the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> dice (Such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strong_in_the_Force\" title=\"Strong in the Force\">Strong in the Force</a>).</p>",
